{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "深", "id": "深"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.1033628914267075, "source": "求", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7965100719866527, "source": "求", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.3561258599220753, "source": "求", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 2.3073356957526436, "source": "性", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.7668906548054945, "source": "性", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.0196536233008624, "source": "性", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.3265064427409172, "source": "性", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.3265064427409172, "source": "禮", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.173804303128121, "source": "禮", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.8861222306763399, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.4792085823537137, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6141885151926982, "source": "人", "target": "深"}, {"weight": 1.3265064427409172, "source": "人", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 2.0196536233008624, "source": "人", "target": "歸"}, {"weight": 0.9210413346327528, "source": "人", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.0737434742455492, "source": "人", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.712800803860808, "source": "歸", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.9636009490515487, "source": "水", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.405947984420753, "source": "水",